     A          R PH201                     TEXT('LA DATA SUBMISSION - HOSP')
     A            H2PRNM        35          COLHDG('PROVIDER NAME')
     A***                            Provider's name to enable identi-
     A***                              fication of Provider
     A            H2PZIP         5          COLHDG('PROVIDER ZIP CODE')
     A***                            Povider's zip code
     A            H2ADDT         8          COLHDG('ADMISSION DATE')
     A***                            Date patient was admitted to
     A***                              hospital (MMDDYYYY)
     A            H2DSDT         8          COLHDG('DISCHARGE DATE')
     A***                            Date patient was discharged from
     A***                              hospital (MMDDYYYY)
     A***                            ***DON'T HAVE--NEED TO CALC***
     A            H2TOS          2          COLHDG('TYPE OF SERVICE')
     A***                            The diag/proc code requiring the
     A***                              greatest resource consumption
     A***                              (severity) should be used to
     A***                              assign the correct type of ser-
     A***                              vice code as follows:
     A***                            1.Acute care, medical
     A***                            2.Acute care, surgical
     A***                            3.Psychiatric
     A***                            4.Chemical Dependency Unit
     A***                            5.Freestanding Rehab Facility
     A***                            6.Skilled nursing facility (Hosp based)
     A***                            7.Skilled Nursing Facility (Freestanding)
     A***                            8.Interm. Care Facility (Hosp based)
     A***                            9.Interm. Care Facility (Freestanding)
     A***                           10.Hospice Care Facility (Hosp based)
     A***                           11.Hospice Care Facility (Freestanding)
     A            H2PRDC         5          COLHDG('PRINCIPLE DIAG CODE')
     A***                            ICD-9-CM diagnosis codes
     A            H2SDC1         5          COLHDG('SEC DIAG CODE 1')
     A            H2SDC2         5          COLHDG('SEC DIAG CODE 2')
     A            H2SDC3         5          COLHDG('SEC DIAG CODE 3')
     A            H2SDC4         5          COLHDG('SEC DIAG CODE 4')
     A            H2SDC5         5          COLHDG('SEC DIAG CODE 5')
     A            H2PRPC         5          COLHDG('PRIMARY PROC CODE')
     A***                            ICD-9-CM or CPT4 Proc Codes
     A            H2SPC1         5          COLHDG('SEC PROC CODE 1')
     A            H2SPC2         5          COLHDG('SEC PROC CODE 2')
     A            H2SPC3         5          COLHDG('SEC PROC CODE 3')
     A            H2SPC4         5          COLHDG('SEC PROC CODE 4')
     A            H2SPC5         5          COLHDG('SEC PROC CODE 5')
     A            H2AGE          2          COLHDG('AGE')
     A***                            Age of patient
     A            H2SEX          1          COLHDG('SEX')
     A***                            Sex of patient (M/F)
     A            H2DCSC         2          COLHDG('DISCHRG STATUS CODE')
     A***                            Patient's status upon discharge
     A***                              from the hospital/facility:
     A***                            1.Home, self care
     A***                            2.Short-term hospital
     A***                            3.Skilled nursing facility
     A***                            4.Intermediate care facility
     A***                            5.Other care facility
     A***                            6.Home health service
     A***                            7.Left against medical advice
     A***                            8.Home intravenous service
     A***                            9.Died
     A***                           10.Still a petient
     A            H2LOS          3          COLHDG('LENGTH OF STAY')
     A***                            The number of days confined
     A***                              during the admission being
     A***                              reported
     A***                            *** MUST BE > 0 ***
     A            H2CHGA         9          COLHDG('CHARGE AMOUNT')
     A***                            The charges incurred during the
     A***                              admission being reported
     A***                            *** ROUND TO NEAREST WHOLE $ AND
     A***                                FORMAT W/O DECIMAL POINT,
     A***                                COMMAS, OR DOLLAR SIGNS ***
     A            H2DCON         7          COLHDG('DATA CONTRIBUTOR')
     A***                            Insurer/Self insurer identi-
     A***                              fication number
